// Renovate, for this repository.
//
// One line, and that is the whole of it. Everything general - when updates
// arrive, what groups with what, what may merge itself - lives in
// Lautstark/.github and names no package.
//
// There are no repository-specific rules here because there is nothing to
// except. This package depends on idb and jszip and on nothing pinned by tag,
// so the two exceptions the family carries elsewhere - the github:-pinned
// @lautstark/* packages, and onnxruntime-web - have no dependency here to
// apply to. An empty packageRules would say the same thing less clearly.
//
// The .json5 is spelled out on purpose: the //path/to/file syntax implies a
// .json extension, so omitting it looks for a file that is not there and
// Renovate stops before it does anything. The shorter "owner/repo:name" form
// implies it too.
{
  $schema: "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  extends: ["github>Lautstark/.github//renovate-shared.json5"],
}
